sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as pg_cron launcher
    participant Lock as advisory lock<br/>(guarded_demo_task)
    participant Manual as manual session

    Cron->>Lock: minute 0: acquire (run A)
    activate Lock
    Note over Cron,Lock: run A sleeps 75s
    Cron--xLock: minute 1: tick skipped<br/>(same jobid still running)
    Manual->>Lock: CALL guarded_demo_task(0)
    Lock--xManual: already running, skipping
    Note over Cron,Lock: run A finishes at 75s
    deactivate Lock
    Cron->>Lock: immediately: acquire (run B)
    activate Lock
    Note over Cron,Lock: schedule has drifted from the clock
    deactivate Lock
